<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx6.SSx3.SSSx3.Px2" title="In Results and Discussion ‣ Mitigation Strategies ‣ Exposing the Cracks: Vulnerabilities of Retrieval-Augmented LLM-based Machine Translation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Training-based fine-tuning enables selective context reliance and outperforms training-free filtering.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx6.SSx3.SSSx3.Px3" title="In Results and Discussion ‣ Mitigation Strategies ‣ Exposing the Cracks: Vulnerabilities of Retrieval-Augmented LLM-based Machine Translation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Low-resource languages face greater difficulty in balancing noise robustness and performance with accurate retrieval.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
