<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Exposing the Cracks: Vulnerabilities of Retrieval-Augmented LLM-based Machine Translation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
